# Swift Testing runs that decide pass or fail start at most this many tests at
# once. Tests on the main actor share one queue: with every test alive, a poll
# waits a lap of all of them, and 5 s deadlines ran out on a busy machine and in
# the full check-swift run. Swift Testing has only the experimental variable;
# `--num-workers` leaves it uncapped (ADR 0210, ADR 0332).
ECHODE_SWIFT_TEST_WIDTH=16
